node_modules/

# The build output. It is embedded into the server binary at compile time by
# `src/api/dashboard.rs`, so what ships is the binary and not this directory. `rust-embed`'s
# `allow_missing` lets a clean checkout compile without it; the server then refuses to start
# with `--dashboard` rather than serving a blank page.
dist/

# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored. CI runs `npm ci`, which is a hard error
# without a lockfile -- the mistake `dxmt-js-sdk/.gitignore` makes, where the same CI step
# therefore cannot have been passing.
